  "messages": [
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 0,
      "offsetInSection": 452,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00000000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 2,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Ah, te voilà.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0016>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 1,
      "offsetInSection": 464,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00410068002C00200074006500200076006F0069006C00E0002E00100002011400160000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 18
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Dame Violine t’attend.<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nDirige-toi de ce pas vers le terrain de combat\nde la Fédération Rixa In Majestatem.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0016>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 2,
      "offsetInSection": 500,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 114
    },
    {
      "displayText": "En d’autres termes : va au sous-sol !\nEt plus vite que ça !<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nJe serais toi, j’éviterais de trop faire patienter\nDame Violine...<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0016>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 728,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 134
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0004>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 996,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00040000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "M<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿ܇on chera chère <U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000> !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0015>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 8,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 1008,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004D00100003110000FF0707006F006E00200063006800650072006100200063006800E800720065002000100002010000000020002100100002011400150000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 32
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Je fus ravie d’apprendre que tu avais atteint\nle rang A au Royale Z-A et que tu avais demandé<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nà ce que se tienne un Royale Z-A ∞.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0015>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 1072,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 137
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Eu égard à ce souhait, j’ai moi aussi organisé\nmon évènement, que j’ai modestement appelé...<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0015>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 1348,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 97
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Les Grands Jeux de Violine S.U. !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0015>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 1544,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004C006500730020004700720061006E006400730020004A006500750078002000640065002000560069006F006C0069006E006500200053002E0055002E0020002100100002011400150000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 38
    },
    {
      "displayText": "À ton avis, à quoi correspond « <U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0006>S.U.<U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0000> » ?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0015>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 9,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 9,
      "offsetInSection": 1620,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00C000200074006F006E00200061007600690073002C002000E0002000710075006F006900200063006F00720072006500730070006F006E0064002000AB002000100002FF0000060053002E0055002E00100002FF000000002000BB0020003F00100002011400150000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 53
    },
    {
      "displayText": "« Show Ultime » ?",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 10,
      "offsetInSection": 1728,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00AB002000530068006F007700200055006C00740069006D0065002000BB0020003F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 18
    },
    {
      "displayText": "« Spectaculaires et Uniques » ?",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 11,
      "offsetInSection": 1764,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00AB002000530070006500630074006100630075006C0061006900720065007300200065007400200055006E00690071007500650073002000BB0020003F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 32
    },
    {
      "displayText": "« La Seule, l’Unique » ?",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 12,
      "offsetInSection": 1828,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00AB0020004C00610020005300650075006C0065002C0020006C20190055006E0069007100750065002000BB0020003F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 25
    },
    {
      "displayText": "« Snobs et Ubuesques » ?",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 13,
      "offsetInSection": 1880,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00AB00200053006E006F006200730020006500740020005500620075006500730071007500650073002000BB0020003F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 25
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Non ! C’est moi qui les organise, quelle serait\nl’utilité de préciser « Show Ultime » ?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0015>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 14,
      "offsetInSection": 1932,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 92
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Presque ! C’est un titre flatteur, mais il lui manque\nun soupçon de... MOI !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0015>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 15,
      "offsetInSection": 2116,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 81
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Oui, c’est cela ! Bravo !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0015>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 16,
      "offsetInSection": 2280,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004F00750069002C002000632019006500730074002000630065006C00610020002100200042007200610076006F0020002100100002011400150000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 30
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Oh ! Quelle image as-tu de moi ?!\nC’est vexant... !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0015>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 17,
      "offsetInSection": 2340,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004F0068002000210020005100750065006C006C006500200069006D006100670065002000610073002D007400750020006400650020006D006F00690020003F0021000A0043201900650073007400200076006500780061006E0074002E002E002E0020002100100002011400150000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 56
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Dans les Grands Jeux de Violine S.U., tu affrontes\nVioline, « la Seule, l’Unique » !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0015>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 18,
      "offsetInSection": 2452,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 89
    },
    {
      "displayText": "En effet, ces jeux consistent à affronter une seule\net unique adversaire : moi !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0015>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 19,
      "offsetInSection": 2632,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 85
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Que tu gagnes ou que tu perdes, tu auras\nl’occasion de m’affronter maintes fois !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0015>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 20,
      "offsetInSection": 2804,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 86
    },
    {
      "displayText": "As-tu une meilleure idée de ce qui t’attend,\nmaintenant ?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0015>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 21,
      "offsetInSection": 2976,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00410073002D0074007500200075006E00650020006D00650069006C006C006500750072006500200069006400E9006500200064006500200063006500200071007500690020007420190061007400740065006E0064002C000A006D00610069006E00740065006E0061006E00740020003F00100002011400150000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 62
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Oui ! C’est une occasion... unique !",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 22,
      "offsetInSection": 3100,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004F007500690020002100200043201900650073007400200075006E00650020006F00630063006100730069006F006E002E002E002E00200075006E0069007100750065002000210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 37
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Pas vraiment.",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 23,
      "offsetInSection": 3176,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00500061007300200076007200610069006D0065006E0074002E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 14
    },
    {
      "displayText": "« Unique », dis-tu ? Ha ha !\nTu ne me déçois pas, <U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000> !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0015>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 6,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 24,
      "offsetInSection": 3204,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00AB00200055006E0069007100750065002000BB002C0020006400690073002D007400750020003F00200048006100200068006100200021000A005400750020006E00650020006D00650020006400E900E7006F006900730020007000610073002C002000100002010000000020002100100002011400150000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 61
    },
    {
      "displayText": "*soupir* Tu dis cela pour me faire répéter, car tu\nadores le son de ma voix. Tu ne m’y prendras pas.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0015>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 25,
      "offsetInSection": 3328,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 105
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Bien ! Je propose de passer aux choses sérieuses.\nQu’en dis-tu, ch<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿࠆer amière amie ?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0015>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 26,
      "offsetInSection": 3540,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 92
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Battons-nous !",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 27,
      "offsetInSection": 3724,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0042006100740074006F006E0073002D006E006F00750073002000210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 15
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Je passe mon tour.",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 28,
      "offsetInSection": 3756,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004A00650020007000610073007300650020006D006F006E00200074006F00750072002E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 19
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Si je puis me permettre un conseil : il serait avisé\nde participer aux jeux de Dame Violine.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0016>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 29,
      "offsetInSection": 3796,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 97
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+001E>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 30,
      "offsetInSection": 3992,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF001E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Comme c’est dommage... J’attends ta prochaine\nparticipation à mes jeux avec impatience !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0015>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 31,
      "offsetInSection": 4004,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 93
    },
